WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.870
An ancient Indian handbook teaches kings
how to build wealth and run a stable

2
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.940
kingdom.

3
00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:11.040
And many Hindus delight in love,
music, good food and beauty.

4
00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:15.860
Yet the same tradition also praises turning
away from the world altogether, towards

5
00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.140
liberation.

6
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:21.030
So is it wrong for a Hindu
to want money and pleasure?

7
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.280
In this mission, you'll meet the classic
Hindu answer to what a human life may

8
00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.370
aim for.

9
00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.720
Then you'll see how the aims fit together,

10
00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:31.150
and how a life can move between them.

11
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.130
Your mission: find out whether wealth
and pleasure belong in a good Hindu life.
